Framefang is a modified version of Kashot
(https://github.com/singhpratech/kashot), by Prateek Singh, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.

Changes from Kashot include, among others: the product name and icon; a
region picker that hands off to a separate, see-through editor window; a
faster overlay; anti-aliased drawing with a new arrow; per-tool color, size
and settings flyouts; automatic copying; a button to the system's own
screenshot-key setting; and the removal of the watermark, Kashot's website,
store packaging and release automation. Modified source files are those
that differ from Kashot's repository at commit 9550e33.

Third-party components are listed in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.
